---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contribute | Fireside Library" activeNav="contribute">

<header class="hero-night overflow-hidden pt-28 pb-16 md:pt-36 md:pb-24 text-white">
  <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <p class="hero-rise hero-eyebrow text-[0.75rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold mb-3">Contribute</p>
    <h1 class="hero-rise text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.05] md:whitespace-nowrap">We could really use your <em>help</em>.</h1>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Intro -->
<section class="pt-12 pb-14 md:pt-14 md:pb-16">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <p class="t-section-title max-w-3xl">We're looking for more contributors.</p>
    <p class="t-body max-w-3xl mt-4">We believe direct conversations with receptive people can be a catalyst for the growth of the Baha'i community as a whole. And the community needs to grow: for the Revelation to reach the wider society and help heal our world, there need to be far more of us doing this work.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How you can help -->
<section class="py-12 md:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <h2 class="t-section-title mb-8">How you can help</h2>

    <ol class="max-w-2xl">
      <li class="flex gap-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center self-stretch">
          <span class="flex-none w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <span class="flex-1 w-px bg-gray-200 mt-2"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-8">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Try it out</h3>
          <p class="t-body">Run a fireside with a few friends, see how it goes, and send us your suggestions. The single most useful thing you can do.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center self-stretch">
          <span class="flex-none w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <span class="flex-1 w-px bg-gray-200 mt-2"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-8">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Write</h3>
          <p class="t-body">Draft new firesides to these standards on new subjects — the thing we need most. We're especially short on materials to spark discovery for people sympathetic to the Faith but not yet investigating, and on materials for newly declared Baha'is.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center self-stretch">
          <span class="flex-none w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <span class="flex-1 w-px bg-gray-200 mt-2"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-8">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Edit</h3>
          <p class="t-body">Sharpen and improve the texts already here. Many are good; some need rewriting.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <span class="flex-none w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Research</h3>
          <p class="t-body">Track down source material and passages from the Writings for firesides in progress.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="t-body max-w-3xl mt-10">If any of this sounds like a way you'd like to serve, here's where to start.</p>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="https://github.com/naysawn/fireside-library" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-900 text-white font-semibold text-[0.9375rem] px-5 py-3 rounded-full no-underline hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
        Find the project on GitHub
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:team@firesidelibrary.org" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-gray-300 text-gray-900 font-semibold text-[0.9375rem] px-5 py-3 rounded-full no-underline hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-gray-900 transition">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-10 5L2 7"/></svg>
        Email the team
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Closing -->
<section class="py-12 md:py-16">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <p class="t-caption italic text-gray-500 max-w-3xl">Thanks for reading this far. Whatever you decide to do is fine — including nothing.</p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
